insertCorrAuPara=Please check the address for the corresponding author that has been added here, and correct if necessary.
inpressRef=Please update Ref. \\$1.
fnmGtThanSix=Please check the length of the author initials and confirm if correct. Else provide the updated reference.
delTelFaxInCorr=Please note that author\u2019s telephone/fax numbers are not published in Journal articles due to the fact that articles are available online and in print for many years, whereas telephone/fax numbers are changeable and therefore not reliable in the long term.
missingTableCaption=Please provide a caption for Tablehash_value{ArabicToRoman_InQuery, \\$2}.
singleListInHgltSec=Highlights were supplied as a paragraph of text and should consist of 3-5 bullet points. We have split the paragraph to meet the requirement. Please check and confirm that you are happy with the changes.
commentForInsertingAff=Please check the address for the corresponding author that has been added here, and correct if necessary.
authorWithOnlyInitials=As per journal style, author names in the author group must have forename and last name in full with middle name as initials if given. First initials are not permitted, unless author provides full middle name as name of use. Kindly check and provide the full first name.
queryForParagraphSec=Your article was submitted with a Data Supplement and/or a Protocol, which is provided with your proof package for your reference only. Unlike your article text, tables, figures, acknowledgment, and appendix materials (when applicable), Data Supplement and Protocol files are not copyedited or composed. They will be included with your published article exactly as submitted. We are unable to make any corrections to these supplemental materials. If any changes to a Data Supplement or Protocol are required, you must make the changes and return the modified file as an attachment with your corrected proof.
defaultQueryForArticleTitle=Please check the article title and amend if necessary.
defaultQueryForChapterTitle=Please check the chapter title and amend if necessary.
queryForArticleIfAuthorPresent=Please verify and confirm the authorship details (author name and surname, affiliation, spelling of author\u2019s name and author\u2019s order) and amend if necessary.
queryForArticleTitle=Have you proof read the whole text to check the accuracy of the copy-editing, plus the completeness and correctness of the text, tables and figures?
defaultQueryForAuthorNames=Please confirm that given names and surnames have been identified correctly and are presented in the desired order and please carefully verify the spelling of all authors' names. Please note that changes in authorship are not allowed in this stage.
queryForAffiliationIsPresent=Please check the accuracy of the affiliations of each author and make changes as appropriate. Affiliations cannot be changed once the article has been published online.
commentForChechAcknowledgment=AUTHOR: Please check that the funding information for this paper is correct and confirm that the sponsor\u2019s name and grant/award numbers have been formatted correctly in the Acknowledgement section and in the Funding statement section.
commentForCheckDataAvailability=AUTHOR: Please check the Data Availability Statement and confirm that all references have been properly cited and identified in the reference list.
commentForMissingRRH=Provide a short running title, making sure to keep it to a maximum of five words.
commentForCommentSubject =AUTHOR: Please provide publication year for the comment article.
commentForReplySubject =AUTHOR: Please provide publication year for the "reply to comment" article.
queryForAbstractMissing=AUTHOR: As per style, an unstructured abstract section is required for the article. Please provide.
queryForOnlineSupplementVariants=Au: The supplement will be published as-is; please review the file now and make any changes that you feel are needed (without using the "track changes" feature).
queryForAMSRequired=BA: AMS classification is required as per JSLD.
raiseQueryAfterDepartmentOfContent=Please note the addition of "Department of" to the affiliation "xxx". We request you to verify the accuracy and appropriateness of this.
standardQueryForArticleTitle=AUTHOR: Please download and complete the Publication Fee Form or Excess Fee Form, which can be found under the \u0022Forms\u0022 tab below, and upload into the Online Proofing System when submitting your proof corrections. If your article has incurred 0 fees you do not need to fill out the form. If you need more time to complete the form, please submit your proof corrections and email the form to the production editor after you have completed the form.
standardQueryWithLinkInArticleTitle=AUTHOR: Please download and complete the Charge Form, which can be found under the Attachments tab below, and return it to journalchargeforms@wiley.com when it has been completed.
commentForCompanionSubject=AUTHOR: Please provide publication year for the companion article.
queryForHighlightsMissingWithSubjectArticle=Au: Please supply 3 to 4 highlights for the article.
queryForHighlightsMissingWithSubjectColumns=Au: Please supply 2 to 3 highlights for the article.
commentForMatchingContent=Your article contains an invalid Data Availability Statement. Please see our Materials and Data Policies &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org/guidelines/policies-and-publication-ethics#MaterialsDataPolicies tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org/guidelines/policies-and-publication-ethics#MaterialsDataPolicies/&gt;here&lt;/link&gt;, provide a suitable Data statement based on the data type in your manuscript. Please note that authors are required to make certain types of data available to readers at the time of publication in specific, stable, community-supported repositories so please ensure to provide a revised Data Availability statement with the accession number(s) and a direct link/URL to this data if your article contains mandatory data.
incorrectWeblinkFormat=Please check that all hyperlinks are displayed correctly and link to the correct website. Please note that hyperlinks must be displayed in full.
queryForAuthorsMissingJSLD=BA: Author byline is required as per JSLD.
queryForMinimumKeywordLimit=Please supply a list of 3 to 10 keywords, as required per journal style.
queryForKeywordLimit=Please supply a list of 3 to 10 keywords, as required per journal style.
queryForCaseReportAndExpression=The title has been modified to conform to Frontiers' requirements. Please confirm that this is fine.
standardQueryForAuthorNamesForSocietyJIDs=The citation and surnames of all of the authors have been highlighted. Check that they are correct and consistent with your previous publications, and correct them if needed. Please note that this may affect the indexing of your article in repositories such as PubMed. If adding/removing authors, or changing the order of this list, please provide us with a signed &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org/files/pdf/Authorship_change_form_Societies.pdf tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org/files/pdf/Authorship_change_form_Societies.pdf/&gt;Authorship Change form&lt;/link&gt;, which should be uploaded as a \u201CRelated Article\u201D file type with your Author\u0027s Proof Corrections. &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2/&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2&lt;/link&gt;
standardQueryForAuthorNamesFseriesJournal=The citation and surnames of all of the authors have been highlighted. Check that they are correct and consistent with your previous publications, and correct them if needed. Please note that this may affect the indexing of your article in repositories such as PubMed. If adding/removing authors, or changing the order of this list, please provide us with a signed &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org/files/pdf/Authorship_change_form.pdf tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org/files/pdf/Authorship_change_form.pdf/&gt;Authorship Change form&lt;/link&gt;, which should be uploaded as a \u201CRelated Article\u201D file type with your Author\u0027s Proof Corrections. &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2/&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2&lt;/link&gt;
queryForPOForEOF_CommentsHaveListWordsOfDeposition=1) Use the following template to provide a revised data statement, and include the link/name of the repository and accession numbers for data: \u201CThe data presented in the study are deposited in the XXX repository, accession number XXX\u201D; 2) Release data or provide confirmation of deposition. Note that your article cannot be published before we receive confirmation of data deposition. &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA82 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA82&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA82&lt;/link&gt;
queryForEditorial=Frontiers Editorials have a specific typesetting format: a link to the Research Topic webpage has been added at the beginning of the Editorial, and any references to Frontiers Research Topic articles have been hyperlinked instead of appearing in the reference list at the end. &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA19 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA19/&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA19&lt;/link&gt;
queryForBeginningOftheArticleWithLink=Confirm that the article title is correct and check that it makes sense. &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA4 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA4&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA4&lt;/link&gt;
stdQueryForKeywordLimit=Reduce the number of keywords to a maximum of eight and a minimum of five. (Note: a keyword can be made up of one or more words.) &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA15 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA15&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA15&lt;/link&gt;
stdQueryForKeyword=Confirm that the keywords are correct, and keep them to a maximum of eight and a minimum of five. (Note: a keyword can be made up of one or more words.) &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA14 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA14&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA14&lt;/link&gt;
queryForFunding=Ensure all grant numbers and funding information are included and accurate (after publication it is not possible to change this information). All funders should be credited, and all grant numbers should be correctly included in this section. &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA46 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA46/&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA46&lt;/link&gt;
queryForIntroductionAndResultMissing=Per journal style, the section headings Introduction and Results/Results and Discussion must be included. Could you please check and insert the headings Introduction and Results/Results and Discussion in appropriate place.
queryForResultAndDiscussionMissing=Per journal style, the section headings Results/Results and Discussion and Discussion must be included. Could you please check and insert the headings Results/Results and Discussion and Discussion in appropriate place.
