queryForResultMissingMissing=Per journal style, a Results/Results and discussion heading must be included. Could you please check and insert the same in appropriate place.
queryForDiscussionMissing=Per journal style, a Discussion heading must be included. Could you please check and insert the same in appropriate place.
queryForAllThreeSectionaHeadingMissing=Per journal style, the section headings Introduction, Results, and Discussion must be included. Could you please check and insert these headings in appropriate place.
standardQueryForAuthorNamesOnMetaData=The citation and surnames of all of the authors have been highlighted. Check that they are correct and consistent with your previous publications, and correct them if needed. Please note that this may affect the indexing of your article in repositories such as PubMed. If adding/removing authors, or changing the order of this list, please provide us with a signed &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org/files/pdf/Authorship_change_form_CRediT.pdf tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org/files/pdf/Authorship_change_form_CRediT.pdf/&gt;Authorship Change form&lt;/link&gt;, which should be uploaded as a \u201CRelated Article\u201D file type with your Author\u0027s Proof Corrections. &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2/&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA2&lt;/link&gt;
queryForFundingWithMetaDataPresent=Ensure all grant numbers and funding information are included and accurate (after publication it is not possible to change this information). All funders should be credited, and all grant numbers should be correctly included in this section. If you provided a positive funding statement but don't provide funding details, then the statement will be updated to say no funding was received. &lt;link id=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA46 tooltip=https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA46/&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA46&lt;/link&gt;
queryForURLPresentInAbstractParastyle=Cell Press strongly prefers to avoid including URLs in the summary. Can you confirm that this can be removed and, if appropriate, suggest an alternative place in the text for the URL?
queryForCOI=Confirm if the text included in the Disclosure of Potential Conflicts of Interest statement is correct.
queryForDeletedAbrstract=Please note that abstract should not allowed for this article type and therefore it was removed. Please confirm.
queryForAuthorsPresent=Author: Please check all author names to ensure that Firstname and Surname data are accurately reflected, and correct errors as needed. If the names are not segmented correctly, indexing by PubMed and other services will be incorrect upon publication.
queryForAffiliationPresent=Author: Please verify the affiliations and their corresponding author links.
queryForFigcaptionPresent=Author: Please confirm quality/labeling of all images included within this article. Figure labels should be legible at 100% zoom of the PDF file to ensure readability in print. Please flag any figures and/or label font sizes that should be adjusted.